D11 creator for whip_core 1.2.0 (LGPL-3.0, like whip_core): the editor of whip-d11-clothing.
Faces by sex, skin by pick, camera keys, NoPixel-style layout (Q/E tabs, Customise panel), "Upper body" with smart
undershirt/arms Combinations, Gloves, search, Versions, outfit photos (d11_photostudio). Needs d11_wardrobe for the
wardrobe data; without it the editor still works, without combinations and gloves.
Apply from resources/: patch -p1 < whip_core-creator-d11.patch

